{"uid":"estorides_core/system_app_sources.py","name":"system_app_sources.py","qualname":"estorides_core/system_app_sources.py","kind":"module","file":"estorides_core/system_app_sources.py","line":1,"end_line":499,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"estorides_core.system_app_sources ================================= Kali OSINT CLI tools as first-class sources (`kind: system_app`).","description":"A system_app source is a YAML-declared local binary executed through the\nexisting :mod:`estorides_core.tool_runner` sandbox (allowlist, no shell,\ninjection blocking, timeouts, output caps) whose output is parsed and fed\ninto the **same** aggregation pipeline as HTTP sources: observations →\nentity extraction → fusion → reliability scoring → recon tiers.\n\nThe YAML schema differs from HTTP sources (`tool.binary` + `tool.args`\ninstead of `tool.url` + `tool.params`) — one registry, two origin kinds,\nzero special-casing downstream.\n\nPublic surface:\n\n    KIND_SYSTEM_APP        \"system_app\" origin kind constant\n    SystemAppResult        frozen dataclass, JSON-serialisable\n    is_system_app          kind/binary predicate\n    tool_available         shutil.which wrapper (monkeypatchable)\n    render_args            {query}/{outdir} template substitution, pure\n    parse_tool_output      parser dispatch with never-raise contract\n    execute                full run: sandbox + parse + audit metadata\n    TOOL_PARSER_NAMES      registered tool-output parsers (for fuzzing)","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["estorides_core/system_app_sources.py::KIND_SYSTEM_APP","estorides_core/system_app_sources.py::KIND_HTTP_API","estorides_core/system_app_sources.py::VALID_KINDS","estorides_core/system_app_sources.py::VALID_OUTPUT_FORMATS","estori